WEBVTT

00:04.600 --> 00:07.590
Please don't sing while I'm driving.

00:07.590 --> 00:09.150
Aw, what?

00:09.500 --> 00:12.980
C'mon, don't flirt with each other.

00:14.880 --> 00:18.490
You're making me jealous.

00:19.020 --> 00:21.580
<i>Crap. They've already found us.</i>

00:37.050 --> 00:42.050
Hey, there. I'm Shirousagi.

00:42.050 --> 00:44.680
I'm a pretty big deal in Redia.

00:45.050 --> 00:47.700
I'm here for your head.

02:19.650 --> 02:23.490
We've found Adonis the witch's apprentice.

02:24.040 --> 02:26.900
Welcome back to the planet's surface.

02:26.900 --> 02:30.250
Unfortunately for you, the coordinates

02:30.250 --> 02:34.260
of your unauthorized transfer 
were on our server.

02:34.810 --> 02:37.760
You underestimated humanity.

02:38.100 --> 02:41.260
Or rather, the Intelligence Agency.

02:41.800 --> 02:45.510
National Intelligence Agency
Women's Intelligence Team

02:43.860 --> 02:48.200
Culprit responsible for recent 
incident in Region 2 identified.

02:48.820 --> 02:51.280
Region 8 thief identified.

02:52.080 --> 02:55.060
Culprit responsible for obscenity
 in Region 5 identified.

02:55.520 --> 03:00.280
Make it quick, Senior Director Shirousagi.

02:56.070 --> 03:00.030
National Intelligence Agency
 Chief Investigator Charmy

03:00.580 --> 03:02.350
<i>I hate overtime.</i>

03:03.690 --> 03:05.370
You heard her.

03:06.550 --> 03:09.400
Isn't it normally 
the other way around, though?

03:09.400 --> 03:12.040
I should be issuing the orders.

03:12.630 --> 03:14.210
<i>I screwed up.</i>

03:14.800 --> 03:17.830
<i>I didn't think they'd find us this quickly.</i>

03:18.540 --> 03:20.770
So, who are they?

03:20.770 --> 03:22.420
Friends of yours?

03:22.420 --> 03:26.560
Oh, these two? I'm not sure either.

03:27.480 --> 03:29.930
They got here first.

03:40.940 --> 03:43.030
Who are you?

04:00.170 --> 04:04.990
We're not the only ones 
after you these days.

04:12.430 --> 04:16.860
They were in the way, so I killed them.

04:17.110 --> 04:18.860
Don't do that!

04:18.860 --> 04:21.360
Huh? Who are you?

04:21.360 --> 04:23.480
I said, don't do that.

04:27.860 --> 04:31.360
You don't like kisses, miss?

04:32.880 --> 04:35.880
Huh? Could it be?

04:36.880 --> 04:37.550
Move!

04:40.940 --> 04:41.960
Written-Style...

04:45.920 --> 04:48.440
Summoning Magic, right?

04:49.020 --> 04:51.430
Your ability names are so long.

05:03.060 --> 05:04.570
Bastard.

05:23.350 --> 05:25.720
Can't hit me!

05:25.720 --> 05:29.550
<i>Judging by his reaction speed, 
he must be a cyborg.</i>

05:32.220 --> 05:33.140
Gaine!

05:36.640 --> 05:37.980
Director!

05:37.980 --> 05:39.980
Don't try to stop it.

05:39.980 --> 05:43.480
Don't worry about me, Little Miss Charmy.

06:08.760 --> 06:10.300
Please stop!

06:10.760 --> 06:13.640
Love Spell: Mandragora!

06:18.620 --> 06:24.140
Mr. Shirousagi, if you won't stop fighting, 
I'm going to restrict your movements.

06:31.540 --> 06:35.030
Nice work. We'll make him
 answer some questions.

06:35.030 --> 06:38.380
About his abilities, what weapons he's carrying,

06:38.380 --> 06:41.670
how many more pursuers there are, if any,

06:41.670 --> 06:45.680
who that drone is communicating with, 
Redia's surveillance systems...

06:45.680 --> 06:47.420
Make him tell us everything.

06:47.950 --> 06:49.820
O-Okay, got it.

06:57.320 --> 06:58.680
What?

07:04.650 --> 07:06.700
Wild!

07:06.700 --> 07:09.210
Now that's a surprise.

07:09.210 --> 07:12.580
You're using a Love Spell.

07:12.580 --> 07:15.210
No wonder you look just like her.

07:15.210 --> 07:15.960
What?

07:17.150 --> 07:19.250
The queen.

07:23.710 --> 07:25.140
And?

07:27.210 --> 07:28.950
Love Spell.

07:27.210 --> 07:30.220
<b>Love Spell</b>

07:30.210 --> 07:32.610
You did such a good job 
hunting those witches.

07:32.610 --> 07:34.230
Yeah. Uh-huh.

07:34.230 --> 07:37.970
So you can die now.

07:41.100 --> 07:50.480
I did <i>everything</i> you asked 
 because I <i>love</i> you.

07:50.760 --> 07:57.750
My queen, I wish I could serve you forever.

07:58.250 --> 08:00.740
Now hurry up and die, okay?

08:04.750 --> 08:06.240
Your Majesty!

08:17.510 --> 08:20.520
I love you...

08:27.780 --> 08:29.420
The queen?

08:29.850 --> 08:32.780
Actually, how is he moving?

08:32.780 --> 08:36.280
Mandragora isn't working? Why not?

08:36.280 --> 08:40.300
I wonder.

08:43.160 --> 08:45.660
A heart symbol...

08:46.850 --> 08:49.430
Is that someone else's spell?

08:52.420 --> 08:56.420
Integrated Enhanced Weaponry Class 10...

08:56.800 --> 08:59.930
Hummingbird: Release.

08:59.890 --> 09:02.430
<b>Humming Bird</b>

09:00.010 --> 09:02.430
<b>Release</b>

09:23.440 --> 09:26.820
The Gear Expansion is out of control.

09:30.330 --> 09:32.910
You're in the way. Get back.

09:34.350 --> 09:37.340
Your Love Spell won't work on him.

09:38.040 --> 09:40.460
You can't help me fight—

09:51.760 --> 09:57.030
A witch who can't use magic 
is a mere woman.

10:02.970 --> 10:06.310
<i>No, that's not what I'm trying to say.</i>

10:06.810 --> 10:08.250
<i>I just...</i>

10:12.580 --> 10:14.380
It's okay.

10:15.350 --> 10:18.070
Even without magic...

10:19.080 --> 10:23.720
I won't let anyone else die.

10:24.500 --> 10:31.280
Honestly, I don't know 
if seeking revenge is wrong or not.

10:32.490 --> 10:33.750
But...

10:34.270 --> 10:36.800
This is the decision I made.

10:37.620 --> 10:40.710
I'll stand by you to the very end!

10:41.600 --> 10:44.290
I won't let you die.

10:44.290 --> 10:47.290
That's the decision I made!

10:51.790 --> 10:54.840
You're full of surprises.

10:56.560 --> 10:57.960
Take this.

11:06.510 --> 11:08.010
What is this?

11:25.480 --> 11:27.680
Neo-Rapier and Meta.

11:25.700 --> 11:28.830
<b>Neo-Rapier</b>

11:25.700 --> 11:28.830
<b>Meta</b>

11:28.980 --> 11:30.820
Huh.

11:31.010 --> 11:32.870
Let's dance, Doroka.

11:35.790 --> 11:40.500
You'll share the same fate, then.

11:55.520 --> 11:57.090
Neo-Rapier.

11:58.860 --> 12:04.720
The Zefal formula around that indestructible
 magical blade allows it to pierce steel.

12:08.290 --> 12:12.510
You can destroy most things 
just by swinging it around.

12:14.800 --> 12:19.800
That said, you should learn 
some basic sword skills.

12:21.670 --> 12:23.310
Here.

12:23.310 --> 12:26.100
It comes with an instruction manual 
even a dumb witch can understand.

12:26.100 --> 12:28.200
I-It's a scroll.

12:28.200 --> 12:29.770
Hey, you two!

12:30.800 --> 12:34.810
I thought I told you to stop flirting.

12:38.040 --> 12:40.840
Hummingbird: Assault.

12:39.820 --> 12:43.820
<b>Humming Bird
Assault</b>

13:02.100 --> 13:03.170
Let's do this.

13:13.480 --> 13:15.470
<i>Each one is weak.</i>

13:31.640 --> 13:32.880
<i>We've got this.</i>

13:34.320 --> 13:35.580
<i>But...</i>

13:56.650 --> 13:58.820
Wait. They...

14:05.070 --> 14:06.560
They just keep coming.

14:17.590 --> 14:19.290
I can't handle them all.

14:22.080 --> 14:23.780
Adonis.

14:23.780 --> 14:25.340
The problem is...

14:29.840 --> 14:31.080
how many there are.

14:31.840 --> 14:35.350
That's not all. They're powerful, too.

14:40.360 --> 14:44.110
Remove Limiter: Increase Output.

14:53.550 --> 14:55.780
Written-Style Summoning Magic:

14:56.520 --> 14:58.160
Gleipnir.

14:57.830 --> 15:01.710
<b>Gleipnir</b>

15:24.520 --> 15:26.060
Let's finish this quickly.

15:26.060 --> 15:27.020
Got it.

15:31.040 --> 15:32.700
Hold on to me.

15:32.700 --> 15:33.760
Huh?

15:35.880 --> 15:38.320
Gleipnir Variant:

15:40.040 --> 15:41.560
Cannonball.

15:41.500 --> 15:45.500
<b>Cannonball</b>

15:46.820 --> 15:49.300
Pretty sick.

15:52.110 --> 15:54.550
That thing is dangerous! 
Don't let it touch you!

15:54.550 --> 15:56.040
<i>Director!</i>

15:56.040 --> 15:59.420
You're still here, Charmy?

16:00.560 --> 16:03.360
Hummingbird: Castle.

16:03.600 --> 16:07.190
<b>Hummingbird</b>

16:03.600 --> 16:07.190
<b>Castle</b>

16:19.040 --> 16:21.960
Director, maximum output.

16:22.590 --> 16:23.450
<i>Now!</i>

16:23.780 --> 16:25.450
Bring it on!

16:54.480 --> 16:57.330
Goodbye, you rabbit bastard!

17:02.670 --> 17:04.250
You underestimate me.

17:05.320 --> 17:06.500
Who's underestimating who?

17:12.250 --> 17:17.370
Show the humans the witches' vengeance.

17:17.760 --> 17:20.260
I'm sorry, Mr. Shirousagi!

17:32.150 --> 17:33.570
Nice work.

17:39.280 --> 17:41.800
You're one tough little girl.

17:41.800 --> 17:44.530
I nearly pissed myself.

17:46.320 --> 17:51.050
But if you're gonna stab someone, 
aim for the head or heart.

17:53.040 --> 17:54.230
Doroka!

17:58.920 --> 18:00.560
You bastard!

18:01.060 --> 18:03.050
Take this!

18:20.760 --> 18:23.080
You flubbed the landing.

18:24.920 --> 18:27.650
But you were on the right track.

18:28.080 --> 18:31.460
In fact, you two are perfectly coordinated.

18:32.450 --> 18:35.520
Aw, shit!

18:40.280 --> 18:41.590
Gotcha.

18:42.590 --> 18:45.090
Don't bother begging for your life.

18:53.110 --> 18:55.600
I'll strangle you to death.

18:56.140 --> 18:58.610
It's not over.

18:59.350 --> 19:00.360
What?

19:01.600 --> 19:02.620
Damn it.

19:09.130 --> 19:10.350
<i>This isn't good.</i>

19:10.350 --> 19:12.620
<i>My spell will vanish 
if I don't keep writing.</i>

19:12.620 --> 19:14.620
Let go of me!

19:17.610 --> 19:21.130
You first...

19:25.730 --> 19:30.900
I decided I wouldn't let Adonis die.

19:34.680 --> 19:39.900
I can't hesitate now.

19:40.570 --> 19:44.410
Steel your resolve already, Doroka.

19:48.220 --> 19:50.400
Behind you! Duck!

19:56.680 --> 19:58.400
Let go!

19:58.920 --> 20:00.930
Please let go!

20:01.570 --> 20:02.810
Damn it.

20:03.420 --> 20:05.160
She always needs my help.

20:49.640 --> 20:51.050
Wait!

20:51.520 --> 20:54.520
<b>Thank you, Adonis.</b>

21:00.530 --> 21:04.030
<b>For walking by my side.</b>

21:06.530 --> 21:09.530
<b>If I could have one wish,</b>

21:29.140 --> 21:30.640
Symbol of

21:29.140 --> 21:30.640
Reconciliation

21:59.420 --> 22:03.420
<b>I wish we could've seen more sights together.</b>

22:06.250 --> 22:07.880
With you...

22:09.110 --> 22:14.180
Sorry, Little Miss Doro-whatever. 
This is the last you'll see of him.
